          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "text": "In a saucepan, Vermische dashi, soy Sauce, und mirin, bringing to a köcheln.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 3,
          "text": "Gib mushrooms und Zwiebel to the simmering broth und Koche für 5 Minuten.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 4,
          "text": "In a Schüssel, beat eggs lightly, then slowly pour into the broth while stirring gently to create threads.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 5,
          "text": "Koche eggs bis just set, about 1-2 Minuten.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 6,
          "text": "Divide cooked Reis among three bowls und ladle mushroom-egg mixture over top.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "ingredientKeys": [],
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "position": 7,
          "text": "garniere mit sliced green onions und nori if desired, then Serviere immediately.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
